hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"298","Sawari ke janwaron ke bare mein: Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Anbas se, Zadham se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali ne teen aadmiyon ko ek khachchar par sawar dekha to kaha: Tum mein se ek utar jaye, kyunke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne teesre par lanat farmayi hai."
"299","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd se, Muhammad ibn Ubayd al-Ansari se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs baghair lagaam aur baghair nakel ke sawari par sawar ho aur woh use gira de ... to unhon ne is ke bare mein sakht baat kahi."
"300","Muhammad ibn Rafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Hasan yani Ibn Atash ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Wadin se - aur mere nazdeek woh Ibn Ata hain - ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs naqat ke sath ek uqba paidal chale to us ke liye ek gardan azad karne ke barabar sawab hai."
"301","Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se; Muhammad ibn Murrah ne mujhe khabar di ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki talwar ka naam Dhu al-Faqar tha, aur Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki zirha ka naam Dhat al-Fudul tha."
